# PDF documents (Golf Sol Ireland)

PDFs fall into three buckets: **server-generated** (brand-aligned `pdf-lib` + shared theme), **browser-generated** (`jspdf` / print-to-PDF), and **admin-supplied** (uploaded PDFs attached to Resend — not generated in this repo).

## Unified PDF shell (preferred for new work)

Use **[gsol-unified-pdf-template.mjs](mdc:server/gsol-unified-pdf-template.mjs)** when adding PDFs that should share one visual system (form submission copy, quote summary, policy PDF, invoice layout, etc.):

- **`drawUnifiedDocumentHeader`** / **`drawUnifiedDocumentFooter`** — emerald band, gold rule, logo, company reg line.
- **`drawUnifiedSectionHeading`**, **`drawUnifiedKeyValueTable`**, **`drawUnifiedParagraphBlock`**, **`drawUnifiedGoldRule`** — body patterns.
- **`loadUnifiedPdfFonts`** + **`embedUnifiedLogo`** — embed once per document.

**Stakeholder sample** (two pages: mock form + quote, then policy-style copy):

- File: `public/samples/golfsol-unified-document-template.pdf`
- Generator: `buildGsolUnifiedPdfTemplateSampleBytes()` (same module) — run `npm run generate:unified-pdf-sample` or `node scripts/generate-gsol-unified-pdf-sample.mjs`
- Browser preview: **`/unified-pdf-sample`** ([unified-pdf-sample-page.tsx](mdc:src/pages/unified-pdf-sample-page.tsx))

Older PDFs (proposal, enquiry record, terms, portal invoice) keep their bespoke layouts until migrated; new flows should start from the unified helpers to avoid drift.

## Shared branding and assets

- **Colours + WinAnsi safety**: [pdf-email-brand.mjs](mdc:server/pdf-email-brand.mjs) exports `pdfEmailTheme`, `brandedPdfAssetPaths` (logo PNG, fleet plate). Align new server PDFs with this palette so they match [email-templates.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/email-templates.mdc) and formal proposals.
- **Helvetica text**: always run user-facing strings through **`sanitizeStandardFontText`** from [shared/pdf-winansi-sanitize.mjs](mdc:shared/pdf-winansi-sanitize.mjs) before `pdf-lib` `drawText`, or embedding will throw on smart quotes / emoji / Irish-specific characters outside WinAnsi.

## Server — `pdf-lib` + Sharp (primary “product” PDFs)

| Output | Entry | Notes |
|--------|--------|--------|
| Client proposals | [proposal-service.mjs](mdc:server/proposal-service.mjs) `createProposalPdf` | Uses `buildProposalDocument` from [shared/document-templates.mjs](mdc:shared/document-templates.mjs), Sharp-resized JPGs, `createProposalFilename`. |
| Sample proposal file | [scripts/generate-sample-proposal-pdf.mjs](mdc:scripts/generate-sample-proposal-pdf.mjs) | Writes `public/samples/sample-proposal.pdf` — same generator as `/api/proposal-pdf` and [proposal-pdf-sample-page.tsx](mdc:src/pages/proposal-pdf-sample-page.tsx). |
| Enquiry / marketing-style PDFs | [enquiry-service.mjs](mdc:server/enquiry-service.mjs) | Large PDF builders (e.g. enquiry record, terms). |
| Trip invoice PDF | [portal-invoice-pdf.mjs](mdc:server/portal-invoice-pdf.mjs) | Branded invoice; sent via [portal-invoice-send-service.mjs](mdc:server/portal-invoice-send-service.mjs) with email + attachment. |
| Branded layout sample | [scripts/generate-branded-sample-pdf.mjs](mdc:scripts/generate-branded-sample-pdf.mjs) | Writes `public/samples/golfsol-branded-layout-sample.pdf` (A4 one-pager, palette + logo). |
| **Unified shell sample** | [scripts/generate-gsol-unified-pdf-sample.mjs](mdc:scripts/generate-gsol-unified-pdf-sample.mjs) | Writes `public/samples/golfsol-unified-document-template.pdf` — master template for all future PDFs. |

**Email + PDF together**: [send-proposal-client-service.mjs](mdc:server/send-proposal-client-service.mjs) builds HTML with `finalizeGsolEmailHtml`, attaches **`getTransactionalEmailImageAttachments()`** plus the proposal PDF bytes. Follow that order when adding new “branded email + PDF” sends.

## Client / hybrid — `jspdf` and DOM capture

- **Transfer VAT receipt**: [transfer-vat-receipt-pdf.ts](mdc:src/lib/transfer-vat-receipt-pdf.ts) (`jspdf`).
- **Business cards export**: [save-business-cards-pdf.ts](mdc:src/lib/save-business-cards-pdf.ts).
- **Client document pages** (welcome / terms views): [client-document-page.tsx](mdc:src/pages/client-document-page.tsx) uses [PdfSiteShell](mdc:src/components/pdf-site-shell.tsx) + `saveElementAsPdf` for optional user-side save.

## Admin → client portal email (attachments + dashboard)

Flow: **`POST` via `/api/send-client-portal-email`** → [client-portal-email-service.mjs](mdc:server/client-portal-email-service.mjs).

- **Auth**: admin JWT (`requireAdminFromBearer`).
- **Attachments**: up to **4** PDFs per send; each **≤ 4 MB**; `filename` + `contentBase64` (raw base64 payload, not a `data:` URL). Only **`.pdf`** is allowed.
- **Email**: [buildBrandedClientPortalEmailHtml](mdc:server/branded-client-portal-email.mjs) + `finalizeGsolEmailHtml` + Resend with image CID attachments + PDF attachments.
- **Portal log**: inserts into **`portal_client_updates`** with `attachment_filenames` (JSON array of **names only**). The dashboard **does not store PDF bytes**; clients re-open files from their **inbox**. UI: [client-dashboard-page.tsx](mdc:src/pages/client-dashboard-page.tsx) (“Messages & files” — lists `PDFs: …` from `attachment_filenames`).

Admin UI that calls this: [admin-dashboard-page.tsx](mdc:src/pages/admin-dashboard-page.tsx) (`handleSendStudioClientEmail` — reads local PDF files, base64, posts JSON).

## Other document emails

- **Terms PDF to inbox**: [enquiry-service.mjs](mdc:server/enquiry-service.mjs) `handleTermsEmailRequest` — `createTermsAndConditionsPdf()` + Resend PDF attachment + transactional HTML.
- **Preset document access** (terms / welcome **pages**, not arbitrary PDFs): [send-client-document-service.mjs](mdc:server/send-client-document-service.mjs) grants `client_document_access` and emails a **dashboard link**; no PDF attachment in that handler.

## Checklist for new server PDFs

1. Reuse **`pdfEmailTheme`** / **`brandedPdfAssetPaths`** where possible.
2. **`sanitizeStandardFontText`** on all dynamic `drawText` strings.
3. If the PDF is emailed, use **`application/pdf`**, sensible `filename`, and keep under Resend / product limits.
4. If the send should appear in the portal timeline, either use **`handleSendClientPortalEmail`** or insert **`portal_client_updates`** with the same shape (and set `attachment_filenames` accurately).

## Committed sample files (regenerate after layout changes)

From repo root:

```bash
node scripts/generate-sample-proposal-pdf.mjs
node scripts/generate-branded-sample-pdf.mjs
npm run generate:unified-pdf-sample
```

Outputs:

- `public/samples/sample-proposal.pdf` — full proposal generator sample.
- `public/samples/golfsol-branded-layout-sample.pdf` — one-page branded strip + fictional invoice lines.
- **`public/samples/golfsol-unified-document-template.pdf`** — **master shell** (form + quote + policy examples on two pages).

**Admin-attached** PDFs in the studio flow are **any** client-valid PDF file the admin chooses; they are not checked into git. For **generated** house-style PDFs, prefer the unified shell above.
